Here’s a standalone HTML5 page for the **Student Helpdesk & Circular Portal**. It uses semantic HTML, a notices table, resource links, an enquiry form, and a small responsive CSS block. Replace the sample notice and download links with official university content.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Student Helpdesk &amp; Circular Portal | MRU</title>
  <style>
    body {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1d2938;
    }

    header, footer {
      padding: 1rem;
      background: #123653;
      color: white;
    }

    nav ul {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    nav a, a {
      color: #075b96;
    }

    header a {
      color: white;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }

    th, td {
      border: 1px solid #bbb;
      padding: 0.65rem;
      text-align: left;
    }

    form {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      max-width: 600px;
    }

    input, select, textarea, button {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0.6rem;
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      width: auto;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body { padding: 0.6rem; }
      table { font-size: 0.9rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Malla Reddy University</h1>
    <p>Student Helpdesk &amp; Circular Portal</p>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#notices">Notices</a></li>
        <li><a href="#resources">Student resources</a></li>
        <li><a href="#enquiry">Submit an enquiry</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section aria-labelledby="welcome-heading">
      <h2 id="welcome-heading">Welcome, Students</h2>
      <figure>
        <img
          src="https://placehold.co/900x280?text=Malla+Reddy+University"
          alt="Malla Reddy University campus banner">
        <figcaption>Student information and academic updates.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p>
        Find academic circulars, examination notifications, campus announcements,
        and useful student resources on this page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="notices" aria-labelledby="notices-heading">
      <h2 id="notices-heading">Latest Notices</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Date</th>
            <th scope="col">Notice</th>
            <th scope="col">Category</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>26 Nov 2026</td>
            <td>End-term examination schedule</td>
            <td>Examinations</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>24 Nov 2026</td>
            <td>Library timings during examination week</td>
            <td>Campus</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>20 Nov 2026</td>
            <td>Academic calendar update</td>
            <td>Academic</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section id="resources" aria-labelledby="resources-heading">
      <h2 id="resources-heading">Downloadable Resources</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="files/academic-calendar.pdf" download>Academic calendar (PDF)</a></li>
        <li><a href="files/exam-guidelines.pdf" download>Examination guidelines (PDF)</a></li>
        <li><a href="files/student-handbook.pdf" download>Student handbook (PDF)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="enquiry" aria-labelledby="enquiry-heading">
      <h2 id="enquiry-heading">Student Enquiry Form</h2>
      <p>Complete the form and the relevant university office can follow up.</p>

      <form action="#" method="post">
        <label for="name">Full name</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>

        <label for="student-id">Student ID</label>
        <input type="text" id="student-id" name="student-id" required>

        <label for="email">University email</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>

        <label for="category">Enquiry category</label>
        <select id="category" name="category" required>
          <option value="">Select a category</option>
          <option value="academics">Academics</option>
          <option value="examinations">Examinations</option>
          <option value="campus">Campus services</option>
          <option value="other">Other</option>
        </select>

        <label for="message">Your enquiry</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>

        <button type="submit">Submit enquiry</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <address>
      Malla Reddy University Student Helpdesk<br>
      Email: <a href="mailto:helpdesk@mru.edu.in">helpdesk@mru.edu.in</a>
    </address>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Malla Reddy University</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
```
